<title>USA: Hallwood expects &quot;significant&quot; Q1 gain.</title>
<headline>Hallwood expects &quot;significant&quot; Q1 gain.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS, Texas 1997-03-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Hallwood Group Inc said Monday it expects to report a &quot;significant&quot; gain in the first quarter of 1997 as a result of a sale of securities.</p>
<p>The company said it sold 2,632,983 shares of a former affiliate, ShowBiz Pizza Time Inc, at $15.68 a share.</p>
